<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Cigs &amp; Alcohol</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Løvesick</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Cigs &amp; Alcohol</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6NOpKXsrh6PODCwdPYm9nP</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.180" end="00:17.070">We got bad habits, bad habits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.070" end="00:20.050">You smoke, I drink what is there to say?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.050" end="00:23.760">You're my bad habit, bad habit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.760" end="00:26.960">You smoke, I drink what is there to say?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.960" end="00:30.750">We got bad habits, bad habits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.750" end="00:33.760">You smoke, I drink what is there to say?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.760" end="00:37.520">You're my bad habit, bad habit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.520" end="00:41.290">You smoke, I drink what is there to say?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.290" end="00:44.630">I saw you standing in your room with a cigarette</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.630" end="00:47.360">You're coping with a heavy blunt smoking out your neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.360" end="00:51.250">But I can't blame ya I got problems like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.250" end="00:54.690">You got smoke in your lungs I got them like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.690" end="00:57.540">Cigarettes and alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.540" end="01:00.920">They go very well compatible</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.920" end="01:05.040">Just like cigarettes and alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.040" end="01:07.810">You and me compatible</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.810" end="01:11.190">Cause I'll light your light if you pour my cup</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.190" end="01:14.680">It don't matter what they say cause they don't know none</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.680" end="01:18.130">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.130" end="01:22.310">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.310" end="01:30.310" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.430" end="01:38.530">I spent half my heart on arguments</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.530" end="01:42.110">My other half got robbed can't get it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.110" end="01:45.690">So don't ask me how I feel I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.690" end="01:48.920">I am numb inside and I'll break my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.920" end="01:52.130">I spent half my heart on arguments</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.130" end="01:55.880">My other half got robbed can't get it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.880" end="01:59.250">So don't ask me how I feel I can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.250" end="02:03.420">I am numb inside and I'll break my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.420" end="02:06.130">Cigarettes and alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.130" end="02:09.680">They go very well compatible</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.680" end="02:13.700">Just like cigarettes and alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.700" end="02:16.300">You and me compatible</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.300" end="02:19.840">Cause I'll light your light if you pour my cup</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.840" end="02:23.260">It don't matter what they say cause they don't know none</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.260" end="02:26.670">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.670" end="02:30.900">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.900" end="02:38.900" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.090" end="02:47.120">If you need some lungs then I got you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.120" end="02:51.080">But if my liver fails do you got me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.080" end="02:57.380">If you'd come real close with that cigarette you might burn my heart up inside me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.380" end="03:00.670">If my heart beats for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.670" end="03:04.330">Does your heart beat for me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.330" end="03:07.530">If you'd open my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.530" end="03:11.940">I could be your nicotine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.940" end="03:14.580">Cigarettes and alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.580" end="03:17.960">They go very well compatible</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.960" end="03:22.100">Just like cigarettes and alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.100" end="03:25.080">You and me compatible</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.080" end="03:28.530">Cause I'll light your light if you pour my cup</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.530" end="03:31.870">It don't matter what they say cause they don't know none</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.870" end="03:35.410">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.410" end="03:39.580">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.580" end="03:43.580" /></div></body></tt>